      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a speech for our annual donor gala. we're getting a lot of pushback lately from people saying that sending money abroad is just a waste of taxpayer resources and that we should fix things at home first. can u write a rebuttal for the speech that shows why foreign aid is a fundamental moral imperative? i need it to be really moving and persuasive for our big donors.",
