    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start, but it sounds a bit too much like a political speech. Can you make it even more powerful? I want to lean harder into the idea that failing to provide this aid isn't just a policy mistake, but a profound moral failure on our part. Focus on the idea that we have a duty to act regardless of the cost.",
