      "content": "That's very intense. It definitely hits those emotional notes. I'm just wondering, how would you respond if someone in the audience actually argued that people can't care about global issues when they are struggling to pay rent or afford healthcare at home? Is there a way to address that without making them sound like they don't care about morality?",
